:: Carter Bedroom Play Between Legs Pose [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
What starts as you can <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> trying to decide what to do, most of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s games revolving around various heroic pretends rather than playing with his collection of toys, the topic of superhero poses comes up. <span style="color:LightGreen">You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> end up doing some rather generic but humorous superhero poses to each other, giving goofy speeches or funny fighting stances as you do so.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
