            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“W- what!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> turns red, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no! That’s weird. Ultraman’s are special trunks, mine are actually underwear! I can’t-”</span> You cross your arms and give <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> a smirk, <span style="color:Pink">asking if he seriously thinks you’ll believe that he’s never done that before. The same boy who poses every chance he gets. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s blush deepening is all the evidence you need.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But… it’s embarrassing to do it in front of someone…”</span> You say it couldn’t be anymore embarrassing than his red face right now, earning you a light smack and glare from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine! But if you laugh, I’ll never forgive you!”</span> <br>
            <br>
            You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> he can’t expect you not to laugh, since it’s bound to look funny, but you at least promise not to tell anyone. <span style="color:Pink">He seems to accept this with a nervous, cheeky look before instructing you to stand on the other side of the room as he opens his underwear drawer and pulls out a pair of Ultraman Briefs. He tries to hide them in his hands, too embarrassed for you to see them even off of his body, though you rightly point out that you’ll see them once he puts them on. Though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> still seems a little shy about you seeing them loose like that.</span> <br>

